The plotting script maps shortage fraction results (either worst annual or average annual depending on dataset) 
for any row of the aggregated results from the 13,312 simulated ensemble, available in the MSDLive data repository:
ADD URL
Specific scenarios of interest can be filtered using the Sobol parameter dataset in the Figure_5_files folder (SALib_parameter_ranges.csv). 

The row indexes (0 indexed) for Figure 5 subplots are: 
a) 13
b) 430
c) 364
d) 551

The values for the table in Figure 5 are from the correspinding row indexes in param_values_13312_sobol_HPC.csv.
Multipliers were converted to volumes using the reference volumes in SALib_parameter_ranges.csv. 
